---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Chaitanya V.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="page-intro">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">ABOUT</span><h1 class="display-title">A little about <em>me.</em></h1></div>
      <p class="lead">I'm interested in how business problems, data and technology come together — and how practical analysis can improve the way organisations work.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section two-col">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">MY BACKGROUND</span><h2 class="section-title">A mix of business experience and analytical learning.</h2></div>
      <div class="body-copy"><p>I'm pursuing an MSc in Business Analytics & Operations Research at KU Eichstätt-Ingolstadt. Before moving into my master's, I worked across finance operations, reconciliations, reporting and process improvement.</p><p>My academic work has expanded that foundation into data analytics, machine learning, automation and applied AI. I enjoy working across the full problem-solving process: understanding the question, working with the data, building an approach and communicating what the results mean.</p></div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section">
      <span class="eyebrow">EXPERIENCE · LATEST FIRST</span><h2 class="section-title" style="margin:12px 0 26px">Where I've worked.</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">AUG 2023 — MAR 2025<br/>REMOTE · NEW YORK-BASED</div><div><h3>Fresh Prints</h3><div class="eyebrow">Business Operations</div><p style="margin-top:12px">My role grew from collections into broader business operations, finance and process automation. I worked on the migration of workflows from Google Sheets and Gmail to Salesforce, contributed SQL-based reporting and dashboards, and used Excel, Zapier and APIs to streamline recurring processes. I also trained and managed two junior team members.</p><p style="margin-top:10px"><strong>Selected impact:</strong> Managed a collections pipeline handling $2.5M+ in overdue receivables; personally delivered approximately $150K in recoveries, contributed to an 18% quarterly cash-flow improvement, and delivered automation savings equivalent to two FTEs.</p></div></article>
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">APR 2021 — JAN 2023</div><div><h3>BNP Paribas</h3><div class="eyebrow">Associate · Investment Banking Services — DEC Receivables</div><p style="margin-top:12px">I worked with trade data and commission processes, coordinated with other investment banks, and played a leading role in migrating the entire process from Portugal to India — from SOP generation through implementation and go-live. My work also involved internal tools, advanced Excel analysis and reconciliations, management presentations on cash flow, Market Access Fees and provision reporting, and other operational reporting.</p></div></article>
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">JAN 2019 — FEB 2020</div><div><h3>Northern Trust</h3><div class="eyebrow">Hedge Fund Accounting</div><p style="margin-top:12px">I began my career in hedge fund accounting, working on reconciliations and accounting operations. I also contributed to automation initiatives that reduced manual workload by an equivalent of four FTEs and received two Spot Awards.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section two-col">
      <div><span class="eyebrow">EDUCATION</span><h2 class="section-title">What I've studied.</h2></div>
      <div class="timeline">
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">2025 — PRESENT</div><div><h3>MSc Business Analytics & Operations Research</h3><p>KU Eichstätt-Ingolstadt, Germany</p></div></article>
        <article class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-date">2015 — 2018</div><div><h3>BCom · Accounting & Taxation</h3><p>Bangalore University, India</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="content-section">
      <span class="eyebrow">SKILLS & LANGUAGES</span><h2 class="section-title" style="margin:12px 0 24px">Areas I work across.</h2>
      <div class="skill-groups">
        <div class="skill-group"><h3>Business & Finance</h3><p class="body-copy">Financial analysis · Reporting · DCF concepts · Reconciliations · Business operations · Process improvement</p></div>
        <div class="skill-group"><h3>Data & Analytics</h3><p class="body-copy">SQL · PostgreSQL · Python · R · Tableau · Power BI · Excel · NumPy · Matplotlib · Data visualisation</p></div>
        <div class="skill-group"><h3>AI & Machine Learning</h3><p class="body-copy">Generative AI · Gemini · LangChain · n8n · Deep learning · CNNs · I-JEPA</p></div>
        <div class="skill-group"><h3>CRM & Digital Transformation</h3><p class="body-copy">Salesforce · Zapier · APIs · Workflow automation · Business process optimisation · Reporting automation</p></div>
        <div class="skill-group"><h3>Research & Strategy</h3><p class="body-copy">Business research · ESG · Sustainability · Strategic analysis · Business model analysis</p></div>
      </div>
      <div style="max-width:620px;margin-top:28px">
        <h3 class="section-title" style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:12px">Languages</h3>
        <div class="language-row"><span>English</span><strong>C1 · IELTS</strong></div>
        <div class="language-row"><span>German</span><strong>B1 · Currently studying</strong></div>
        <p class="body-copy" style="font-size:12px">Completed A2 at college; currently studying B1.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
